  "brief": {
    "zh": "先拿到能量核心，再到达出口。两个机器人会追踪你，另一个守在固定巡逻路线上。同一段程序要适应不同棋盘。",
    "en": "Pick up the power core and reach the exit. Two bots track you while another follows a fixed patrol route. Use one program on different boards."
  },
  "hints": [
    {
      "zh": "每回合通过 scan() 读取当前坐标。有核心时把它设为目标，拾取后把出口设为目标。",
      "en": "Use scan() to get your current position each turn. Target the core first and the exit after picking it up."
    },
    {
      "zh": "调用 shortest_step(棋盘, 当前坐标, 目标坐标)。也可以从 my_algorithms 导入自己通过测试的版本。",
      "en": "Call shortest_step(board, position, goal). You can also import your own tested version from my_algorithms."
    },
    {
      "zh": "到了核心格才用 pick()。只读取地图或计算路线不会花费回合。",
      "en": "Use pick() once you reach the core. Reading the board and calculating a route take no turns."
    },
    {
      "zh": "把对手当前占住的格子暂时当成墙。每走一步就再读取场地，让最短路随着对手的位置变化。",
      "en": "Treat squares currently occupied by rivals as temporary walls. Scan again after each step and recalculate as rivals move."
    }
